{
  "dom_id": "step-e12879",
  "name": "Example: Determining an Unknown Quantity Using Exterior Angles",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14193271/assets/0f2d7f92335d965840f8714dc4ceeb43201ecee2ada9b7aeb7eb54437a0f7d0f.png)\n\nFind the value of $x.$",
  "worked_solution": "Note that the measure of the exterior angle at $A$ is $180^\\circ - 90^\\circ=90^\\circ$ and the measure of the exterior angle at $D$ is $180^\\circ - 2x.$ \n\nSince the sum of the exterior angles of a polygon is $360^{\\circ},$  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{90}^{∘}+(x+{10}^{∘})+({180}^{∘}-2x)+x+(x+{10}^{∘}) & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ x+{290}^{∘} & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ x & ={70}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e12879\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Determining an Unknown Quantity Using Exterior Angles</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e12879\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n         